<root class="showcase-container">
  <div class="section-divider">Pine UI — primitive library</div>

  <p class="lead" style="margin-bottom:0.5rem">Unstyled, accessible UI primitives for pocopine.</p>
  <p style="font-size:0.875rem;margin-bottom:2rem">
    Every primitive below animates by default — Dialog fades, menus
    slide, TagsInput chips FLIP on reorder, Collapsibles grow. No
    handler code, no CSS to copy.
  </p>

